            </svg>
            <span>WhatsApp Smile Team</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-japandi-sand/50 border border-japandi-clay/40 shadow-sm space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-japandi-moss tracking-widest">The House of Dental Aesthetic Edge</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-xs font-light text-japandi-earth">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss/20 text-japandi-moss flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">&check;</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Digital 3D Smile Preview:</strong> Test-drive your smile with clinical mock-ups before treatment.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss/20 text-japandi-moss flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">&check;</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Micro-Thin E-Max Veneers:</strong> Maximum natural tooth enamel preservation with lifelike vitality.
