            Ultra-thin ceramic laminates bonded to the front of teeth to correct deep discoloration, chips, gaps, and minor misalignments permanently.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-japandi-cream border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-4">
          <div class="text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-moss">Composite Bonding</div>
