        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Conveniently located for patients across Hennur Bande, Horamavu Agara Road, Kalyan Nagar, HRBR Layout, Banaswadi, Kammanahalli, Babusapalya, and Kothanur. House of Dental brings world-class cosmetic dentistry, Digital Smile Design, and flexible monthly EMI plans to your doorstep.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
